<title>JAPAN: NTT says to raise capital investment.</title>
<headline>NTT says to raise capital investment.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nippon Telegraph and Telephone Corp (NTT) said on Friday it plans to raise its capital investment for the current fiscal year to 1.98 trillion yen from the originally planned 1.92 trillion yen.</p>
<p>The extra investment was needed because of strong demand for NTT's digital communication lines, NTT president Junichiro Miyazu told a news conference.  </p>
<p>NTT said it plans to invest 110 billion yen in the current business year to build digital communication lines used mainly to access the Internet and other online services.</p>
</text>
